1
00:00:00,589 --> 00:00:04,799
(Beverley(gives him an uncomfortable hug):)I'm getting a warm feeling
spreading through my heart.

2
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:07,680
(Penny:)That's the Del Taco.

3
00:00:13,477 --> 00:00:17,397
(Sheldon:)Why is Leonard softly banging his head
against his bedroom door?

4
00:00:18,231 --> 00:00:20,651
(Beverley:)Speaking of warm feelings....

5
00:00:20,817 --> 00:00:22,817
(Beverley:)Come here.

6
00:00:31,703 --> 00:00:34,543
(Beverley:)No, I'd rather have the busboy.

7
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:44,130
(Beverley:)Thank you for taking me to the airport.

8
00:00:44,299 --> 00:00:46,299
(Sheldon:)You're very welcome.

9
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:49,930
(Leonard:)Once again, I'm driving.
I'm right here.

10
00:00:50,097 --> 00:00:52,307
(Beverley:)Please, I am very hung-over...

11
00:00:52,516 --> 00:00:57,026
(Beverley:)...and in no mood
to satisfy your need for approval.

